{% comment %} ticker: t. Two identical groups in one track that slides left by half its width, so the loop has no seam. The words are decoration (the address is in "Find us"), so they are hidden from screen readers. The whole ticker is one button without a visible mark: a tap, a click or Enter pauses the movement and starts it again (WCAG 2.2.2). {% endcomment %}
<button class="ticker" type="button" data-ticker aria-pressed="false" aria-label="{{ t.ticker_pause }}">
  <span class="ticker__view" aria-hidden="true">
    {%- for group in (1..2) %}
    <span class="ticker__group">{%- for round in (1..2) %}{%- for word in t.ticker %}<span>{{ word }}</span><i></i>{%- endfor %}{%- endfor %}</span>
    {%- endfor %}
  </span>
</button>
